          "text": "<div class=\"chatgptbox-genui\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-fragment\" style=\"\"><h3 class=\"chatgptbox-genui-title chatgptbox-genui-size-lg\" style=\"font-size:20px\">结论：先走官方 CDS + ADS，注册一次，后续自动化</h3><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">这是目前最可靠、用户操作最少的路线：<strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">CDS 获取 ERA5 三维云场，ADS 获取 CAMS EAC4 AOD550</strong>。两个服务共用 ECMWF 账号和 API Key，只需分别接受数据集许可。</div><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">它们完整覆盖你的历史日期，支持服务端按区域裁剪，避免下载全球数据。<a href=\"https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/datasets/reanalysis-era5-pressure-levels?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"ERA5 hourly data on pressure levels from 1940 to present\">[cds.climate.copernicus.eu]</a> <a href=\"https://ads.atmosphere.copernicus.eu/datasets/cams-global-reanalysis-eac4?tab=overview&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"CAMS global reanalysis (EAC4)\">[ads.atmosphere.copernicus.eu]</a> <a href=\"https://confluence.ecmwf.int/spaces/DAC/pages/453683015/Using%2Bthe%2BECMWF%2Bdata%2Bstore%2B-%2BECDS?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"Using the ECMWF data store - ECDS - Data and Charts\">[ECMWF Confluence Wiki]</a></div><h3 class=\"chatgptbox-genui-title chatgptbox-genui-size-md\" style=\"font-size:16px\">1. 为什么这样选？</h3><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-scroll\"><table class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table\" style=\"\"><tr class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-row\" style=\"\"><th class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\" scope=\"col\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">数据源</div></th><th class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\" scope=\"col\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">核心字段</div></th><th class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\" scope=\"col\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">主要代价</div></th><th class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\" scope=\"col\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">判断</div></th></tr><tr class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-row\" style=\"\"><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\"><a class=\"chatgptbox-genui-link\" style=\"\" href=\"https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/datasets/reanalysis-era5-pressure-levels?tab=download&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\">CDS ERA5</a></div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">五项逐层变量齐全</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">免费账号、许可</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\"><strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">主路线</strong></div></td></tr><tr class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-row\" style=\"\"><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\"><a class=\"chatgptbox-genui-link\" style=\"\" href=\"https://github.com/google-research/arco-era5?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">Google ARCO ERA5</a></div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">齐全、匿名访问</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">每变量每小时约 154 MB 全球分块</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">不适合小区域批量</div></td></tr><tr class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-row\" style=\"\"><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\"><a class=\"chatgptbox-genui-link\" style=\"\" href=\"https://earthdatahub.destine.eu/collections/era5/datasets/era5-pressure-levels?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">DestinE Earth Data Hub</a></div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">齐全</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">另需 API Key；60 天×15°分块</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">备用</div></td></tr><tr class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-row\" style=\"\"><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">Google Earth Engine</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">齐全、服务端裁剪</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">Google Cloud 项目及授权</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">已有项目时可考虑</div></td></tr><tr class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-row\" style=\"\"><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">Earthmover ERA5</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">缺 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">cc/clwc/ciwc</code></div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">字段缺失</div></td><td class=\"chatgptbox-genui-table-cell\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">排除</div></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">Google ARCO 的 10 天、5 变量读取对应约 <strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">185 GB 未压缩全球分块</strong>，实际传输量受压缩影响。官方 CDS 则直接裁剪所需区域。<a href=\"https://github.com/google-research/arco-era5/blob/main/README.md?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"arco-era5/README.md at main · google-research/arco-era5\">[GitHub]</a> <a href=\"https://earthdatahub.destine.eu/collections/era5/datasets/era5-pressure-levels?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"ERA5 hourly data on pressure levels\">[Earth Data Hub]</a> <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-science/ai-weather-models-with-earthmover-data/blob/9e063d181ace66d0824ad1ffd8b6d8d15bac2324/docs/DATA_SOURCES.md?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"docs/DATA_SOURCES.md · hugging-science/ai-weather-models-with-earthmover-data at 9e063d1\">[Hugging Face]</a> <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/earth-engine/guides/access?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"Earth Engine access  |  Google Earth Engine  |  Google for Developers\">[Google for Developers]</a></div><h3 class=\"chatgptbox-genui-title chatgptbox-genui-size-lg\" style=\"font-size:20px\">2. 用户实际只需做三件事</h3><ol class=\"chatgptbox-genui-list\" style=\"\"><li class=\"chatgptbox-genui-list-item\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">打开 <a class=\"chatgptbox-genui-link\" style=\"\" href=\"https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/how-to-api?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">CDS API 设置页</a>，点击 <strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">Register</strong> 注册、验证邮箱并登录。</div></li><li class=\"chatgptbox-genui-list-item\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">分别进入 <a class=\"chatgptbox-genui-link\" style=\"\" href=\"https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/datasets/reanalysis-era5-pressure-levels?tab=download&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\">ERA5 下载页</a> 和 <a class=\"chatgptbox-genui-link\" style=\"\" href=\"https://ads.atmosphere.copernicus.eu/datasets/cams-global-reanalysis-eac4?tab=download&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\">EAC4 下载页</a>，在下载表单底部接受各自的 <strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">CC-BY 许可</strong>。</div></li><li class=\"chatgptbox-genui-list-item\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">登录 <a class=\"chatgptbox-genui-link\" style=\"\" href=\"https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/how-to-api?utm_source=chatgpt.com\">CDS API 设置页</a>，取得个人访问令牌。后续在 macOS 本地配置 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">~/.cdsapirc</code> 并安装 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">cdsapi&gt;=0.7.7</code>。令牌保留在本地，无需发到聊天中。</div></li></ol><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">ADS 使用同一个令牌，但 API 地址须指定为 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">https://ads.atmosphere.copernicus.eu/api</code>；CDS 为 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/api</code>。<a href=\"https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/en/how-to-api?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"CDSAPI setup\">[Climate Data Store]</a> <a href=\"https://ads.atmosphere.copernicus.eu/how-to-api?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"CDSAPI setup\">[Atmosphere Data Store]</a> <a href=\"https://confluence.ecmwf.int/spaces/DAC/pages/453683015/Using%2Bthe%2BECMWF%2Bdata%2Bstore%2B-%2BECDS?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"Using the ECMWF data store - ECDS - Data and Charts\">[ECMWF Confluence Wiki]</a></div><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">**想先拿到真实样本：**完成前两步后，可以直接在 ERA5 网页下载一小时 GRIB，暂时跳过 API 配置。</div><h3 class=\"chatgptbox-genui-title chatgptbox-genui-size-lg\" style=\"font-size:20px\">3. 确定的下载规格</h3><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">**ERA5：**选择 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">Reanalysis</code>、逐小时、0.25°、区域 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">[38,110,26,132]</code>（北、西、南、东）。</div><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">字段为 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">fraction_of_cloud_cover</code>、<code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">specific_cloud_liquid_water_content</code>、<code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">specific_cloud_ice_water_content</code>、<code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">temperature</code>、<code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">geopotential</code>。</div><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">建议在要求的 11 层上增加 <strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">100/70/50 hPa</strong>，共 14 层。</div><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">单位分别是云量 0–1、云液水/冰水 kg/kg、温度 K、位势 m²/s²。位势高度可用 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">z/9.80665</code> 近似转换；地形可另取 ERA5 single-level geopotential。<a href=\"https://confluence.ecmwf.int/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=185081924&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"ERA5: data documentation - Copernicus Knowledge Base\">[ECMWF Confluence Wiki]</a></div><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">先下载 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">2023-06-01 10:00 UTC</code> 单小时作读取验收，再获取 <strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">2023-05-31 至 2023-06-10 UTC</strong> 全时次，覆盖北京时间 6 月 1 日清晨及全部 20 场事件。</div><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\"><strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">CAMS EAC4：<strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">选择 <code class=\"chatgptbox-genui-code\" style=\"\">total_aerosol_optical_depth_550nm</code>，0.75°、每三小时。它是</strong>整柱二维、无量纲 AOD</strong>，属于快速访问字段，2022–2023 年可用。<a href=\"https://ads.atmosphere.copernicus.eu/datasets/cams-global-reanalysis-eac4?tab=overview&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"CAMS global reanalysis (EAC4)\">[ads.atmosphere.copernicus.eu]</a> <a href=\"https://confluence.ecmwf.int/pages/viewpage.action?navigatingVersions=true&amp;pageId=340784983&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"CAMS: Global atmospheric composition forecast data documentation - Copernicus Knowledge Base\">[ECMWF Confluence Wiki]</a></div><h3 class=\"chatgptbox-genui-title chatgptbox-genui-size-lg\" style=\"font-size:20px\">4. 数据量和后续链路</h3><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">按 14 层、五变量、float32 估算：</div><ul class=\"chatgptbox-genui-list\" style=\"\"><li class=\"chatgptbox-genui-list-item\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">首批含 UTC 前置日：约 <strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">0.32 GB</strong> 原始数值。</div></li><li class=\"chatgptbox-genui-list-item\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">完整标注期：约 <strong class=\"chatgptbox-genui-bold\" style=\"\">16 GB</strong>。</div></li><li class=\"chatgptbox-genui-list-item\" style=\"\"><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">官方单请求字段上限文档列为 120,000；按月请求最多约 52,080 字段，符合官方推荐的拆分方式。实际 GRIB 大小与排队时间依服务情况变化。<a href=\"https://confluence.ecmwf.int/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=601307425&amp;utm_source=chatgpt.com\" title=\"Climate Data Store (CDS) documentation - Copernicus Knowledge Base\">[ECMWF Confluence Wiki]</a></div></li></ul><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">完成授权后，后续的按月提交、失败重试、GRIB 读取、字段及时间校验、区域裁剪和数据归档都适合由本地程序自动完成。</div><div class=\"chatgptbox-genui-text\" style=\"\">**最后一个实验边界：**ERA5 提供网格平均云量与云水，仍需重建云重叠和散射。建议保持既有基线与冻结光学模型不变，分别替换 GFS/ERA5 输入，才能区分输入误差与光学结构误差。</div></div></div>"
